401 Client Error: Authorization Required
{noformat}

(And similar for expired tickets). It would be helpful to catch these and display more useful information, such as a suggestion to run {{kinit}}. $acceptance criteria:$

description:
From design doc: 
{quote}
To handle revocable resources correctly Aurora needs to de-generalize and simplify its internal resource representation. The new resource vector should be capable of aggregating resources by revocable flag. This will require refactoring existing resource handling (including  AURORA-105), which will also help to support Mesos framework role in future.
{quote}

