description:
Address this TODO:
{noformat}
  /**
   * Encapsulate an offer from a host, and the host's maintenance mode.
   */
  class HostOffer {
    private final Offer offer;

    // TODO(wfarner): Replace this with HostAttributes for more use of this caching.
    private final MaintenanceMode mode;
{noformat}

Success here will mean avoiding O(n) (n=num offers) fetching of host attributes associated with offers when scheduling a task.

