[Switching to Thread 0x7fffeedb5700 (LWP 3841832)]
0x00007ffff7f4a417 in qd_compose_end_map () at /home/gordon/projects/dispatch/src/compose.c:179
179	    DEQ_INSERT_HEAD(field->fieldStack, comp);
