description:
Extract the version numbers out of the build.gradle file and into gradle.properties for the geode-benchmarks repo, like we have done with geode-examples.

This will have the side benefit that we will then be able to run the benchmarks against an old geode release by passing a command line parameter, eg.

{noformat}
./gradlew benchmark -Pgeode.version=1.6.0
{noformat}

