description:
There is a bug in [documenation|http://apache.github.io/mahout/doc/ScalaSparkBindings.html] (2.3.5 Collecting to HDFS). Instead of:
{code}
A.writeDRM(path = hdfsPath)
{code}
should be
{code}
A.dfsWrite(path = "<non_existing_hdfs_directory>")
{code}

