description:
Currently two formats of credentials are supported: JSON

{code}
  "credentials": [
    {
      "principal": "sherman",
      "secret": "kitesurf"
    }
{code}

And a new line file:
{code}
principal1 secret1
pricipal2 secret2
{code}

We should deprecate the new line format and remove support for the old format.

